      ],
      "text": "The tool surface includes read tools (file_read, grep, list_dir, glob, repo_search), approval-gated mutation tools (file_write, file_edit, apply_patch, batch_edit, shell), workflow tools such as run_tests and web_fetch, and MCP tools surfaced as mcp__<server>__<tool>."
